Power System Stability and Control — Kundur and Malik (@pe-kundur: 0, is #reference, #part-of @pe-sources) { r_5Y16A8DP62RPS6C0N6QXSWN1SB
Prabha S. Kundur and Om P. Malik. Power System Stability and Control, second edition, McGraw Hill, 2022. Print ISBN 9781260473544. [Publisher record](https://www.mheducation.com/highered/mhp/product/power-system-stability-control-second-edition.html).

An optional commercial whole-book graduate companion to the free courses, methods and author-hosted mathematical reading. Read full equipment/modelling, stability and control developments with substantial problems rather than relying on a summary. Compare it with the public dynamical-system courses and newer inverter-based primary work.

The publisher identifies copyright 2022 and publication 1 July 2022; metadata checked on 29 October 2026. A separate publisher seasonal catalogue gives a different sales date, so cite the actual edition rather than treating all dates as identical. Full text was not inspected. Obtain an authorized library or licensed copy; a public description/excerpt is not an open edition. No book or unofficial PDF is supplied, and it is not the sole route to required theory.

